* The Euler factor of Lemma 3.3(a) at a prime dividing exactly one of R, S vanishes: hPrime ( p ) = f ( p ) - 1 = - p, so 1 + hPrime ( p ) / p = 0 (Lean sum_hBV_div_eq, hzero).

